From: Razman Zaidi <100824525+idiazraz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:21:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Open and close animations for toplevel windows

Opening windows fade in and grow from 94% of their size; closing windows
are copied into memory before their buffer goes away, then fade out and
shrink. Both follow org.gnome.desktop.interface enable-animations.
